Who is the Greatest International Soccer Striker of All Time?

The debate is simple to ask and difficult to answer: a striker can score brilliantly, but greatness also depends on consistency, tournament impact, and career-defining moments.


In a 20–30 second pitch, this project turns that debate into a data-backed argument by combining international goals with performance measures that capture the full story behind elite strikers.

